I think I found a bug in the eating code (beta 3.1a).  Unfortunately,
it killed me in the best game I've ever had.

I had armor class -30, +6 Mjollnir, all stats at 18, intrinsic
everything and all the goodies.  I was ready to kick some butt!

About level 17 I entered a nice beehive and proceeded to dispatch
its denizens, then settled in for a power-up pork-out.
After eating three or four lumps of royal jelly, I got the warning about
having trouble getting it all down.  I responded 'y' to stop, then
waited about 50 moves.  The stat line still indicated "satiated," but
I thought I'd try another delicious jelly lump.  Imagine my surprise
when I suddenly choked on my food and died!  I was not given a chance
to stop.

Oh well, guess I'll go get some real work done....
